      <h1>About Vigorix Prime</h1>
      <p class="lead">Honest, evidence-based guidance for the supplements, performance products and grooming gear that help men live stronger.</p>

      <p>Vigorix Prime started with a simple frustration: shopping for men's health products had become an exhausting maze of conflicting star ratings, influencer hype and bold label claims that told you everything except whether a product was actually worth buying. We built this site to cut through that noise.</p>

      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <p>Our team researches, compares and ranks products across the categories that matter most to how men look, feel and perform — everyday supplements, training and performance formulas, vitality support, and grooming gear. Every guide is organized to answer the questions real shoppers ask first: which one is best, which one is the smartest value, and which one fits my specific goal.</p>

      <h2>How We Evaluate Products</h2>
      <p>We combine hands-on research with structured comparison. That means looking closely at ingredient quality and dosing, third-party testing and certifications, published evidence, build quality and performance (for hardware), value per serving, and the long-term reliability signals from verified buyers. When a product underperforms or simply does not justify its price, we say so — a recommendation only means something if we are willing to leave products off the list.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>We prioritize clinically meaningful doses and real results over marketing buzzwords.</li>
        <li>We weigh price against quality and effectiveness, not in isolation.</li>
        <li>We update our guides as new products launch and prices shift.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Independence</h2>
      <p>Vigorix Prime earns commissions through affiliate links, including the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program. Those commissions never influence our rankings or opinions. We choose which products to feature based on merit, and you can read the full details on our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> page.</p>

      <h2>A Note on Health</h2>
      <p>Our content is for general information only and is not medical advice. Supplements and health products affect people differently — always check the label and talk to a qualified healthcare professional before starting anything new, especially if you take medication or manage a health condition. Vigorix Prime is intended for adult men.</p>

      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>Have a product you'd like us to cover, or feedback on a guide? We'd love to hear from you — head over to our <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page and send us a note.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us by Email</h2>
      <p>You can also reach us directly by email:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>General questions &amp; feedback: <a href="mailto:info@vigorixprime.com">info@vigorixprime.com</a></li>
        <li>Advertising &amp; affiliate partnerships: <a href="mailto:affiliate@vigorixprime.com">affiliate@vigorixprime.com</a></li>
      </ul>
